  "unreadable": [],
  "notes": "Header labels from the diagram callouts; the enclosure plate prints a second list (left: 3V3 GND ETX ERX EIO0 EIO1 EIO2 EIO3 EIO8 EIO7 EIO4 EIO6 EIO5 top to bottom; right: IO23 ... VIN) which is recorded in functions. QWIIC labels from the callouts 3V3 GND IO02(SDA) IO03(SCL) and 3V3 GND IO21(RX) IO20(TX). The 1:GND ... 13:GND list is printed on the enclosure above a small FPC connector window. The 2-pin connector beside it is unlabelled and skipped. LCD, touch, TF card, HDMI and UART tables are internal.",
  "uncertain": [
    "left-header: the diagram callouts (E-IO02, E-IO03, E-IO04, E-IO05, E-IO21, E-IO20, E-IO08, E-IO19, E-IO09) disagree with the enclosure/PCB labels (EIO0, EIO1, EIO2, EIO3, EIO8, EIO7, EIO4, EIO6, EIO5) for positions 1-9; the PCB silkscreen EIO6 beside the second-from-bottom pin matches the enclosure list. Callout used as label, enclosure name kept in functions.",
    "QWIIC connectors: enclosure boxes read GND 3V3 SDA SCL and GND 3V3 RX TX, while the callouts read 3V3 GND ... ; the GND/3V3 order of each QWIIC is therefore uncertain (callout order used).",
    "fpc-connector: 13 numbered entries are printed above a small FPC connector, but the image does not show which physical contact is 1 or that all 13 belong to that connector (13:GND is printed apart from the others)."
  ]
